"""Human review documents from the bound completion matrix."""
import json
from collections import Counter

def reports(out,rows,s,inventory,evidence):
 def write(name,lines):(out/name).write_text('\n\n'.join(lines)+'\n')
 done=[x for x in rows if x['newCompleted']]
 lines=['# DFR-04 Evidence Recovery','RESEARCH_PROVISIONAL · 2026-11-05 · Six issuers only. No new source acquisition or request for previously supplied files.',f"Searched retained PDF statements/notes, CaféF JSON, combined JSON and prior issuer evidence. {len(inventory['documents'])} note-document variants indexed; {len(inventory['priorEvidence'])} retained prior issuer JSON files pinned. Keyword hits remain CANDIDATE_ONLY. Source inventory preserves variant identity, PDF existence/hash, physical page and exact notes pointer. It does not claim every page was substantively reviewed.",'Reusable mapping: candidate-index.json → evidence-map.json qualified observations → preparation topic bindings → separate challenge → completion-matrix.json. Financial/business/industry/governance/valuation/conflict categories are reusable; rubric topic sets and exact bands are imported unchanged from M3. A hit on competition in an accounting policy is not market evidence.','Amounts in reviewed observations remain native-unit decimal strings with original displayed values. No new ratios or float calculations; no CafeF scale is guessed. Retained text stays unreviewed globally; only named bounded observations are qualified for provisional interpretation. Source dates are reporting periods, not invented publication dates.','Original-PDF exception pages inspected: TCX14,29; VIC15,18,37,38,86; VHM20,38,65. FPT uses retained previously checked interim comparability review, not a new PDF reread. VHM named one-offs reuse verified v4 readings. VNM annual-report physical pages26,27,36,97,98 (printed spreads50–53,70–71,192–195) were subsequently inspected for actual industry, governance and operational-risk content. No BID page was newly visually reviewed. All prior metrics and ratings remain unchanged.','## Qualified recovery']
 for e in evidence['qualified']:
  lines.append(f"- **{e['id']}** — {e['summary']} Source `{e['path']}` `{e['jsonPointer'] or '/'}`; page {e.get('page','prior review')}; hash in evidence-map.json. Qualified topics: {', '.join(e['qualifiedTopics'])}.")
 lines+=['## Source exceptions and limitations','VIC86 and VHM20 OCR reading order differs from physical column layout. VIC current-year disposal/writeoff is 2,994,348 million VND, prior 1,372,415; VHM current investment-gain cash adjustment is −28,111,513 million VND, prior −24,574,340. Original-page observations override those OCR interpretations locally. No DFR02 metric record is rewritten. Existing common-earnings/NCI uncertainties and unknown CaféF units remain. No newly verified contradiction to a DFR02 supported financial metric was identified; parity does not assert all conditional estimates are valid.','The VNM annual report supplies bounded issuer-authored industry and operating-risk analysis, including attributed external references. This supports IC-IND and RG-RISK with qualifications; it is not independently retrieved peer/share/cost evidence or a full minority-outcome assessment. Other issuers retain their distinct gaps. False keyword hits such as “thì phân bổ” in goodwill policy are not market-share evidence. GENUINELY_ABSENT means the required qualified product was not located in this bounded retained corpus; candidate words may exist. This is not a claim that the information does not exist anywhere.']
 write('DFR_04_EVIDENCE_RECOVERY.md',lines)
 lines=['# DFR-04 Batch Assessments',f"{s['baselineCompleted']} inherited + {s['newCompleted']} newly completed = {s['completed']}/138. Four analyst-pending items resolved first. All are RESEARCH_PROVISIONAL; exact M3 bands unchanged. Distinct preparation/challenge passes are by ChatGPT, not independent human acceptance."]
 for x in done:
  a=x['assessment'];lines += [f"## {x['id']} — {x['points']}/{x['maxPoints']} · {x['band']}",a['rationale']]
  for e in a['evidence']:lines.append(f"**{e['topic']}**: {e['rationale']} ({', '.join(e['refs'])})")
  lines += ['Counterevidence: '+' '.join(e['rationale'] for e in a['counterevidence']),'Assumptions: '+' '.join(a['assumptions']),f"Confidence: {a['confidence']}. Invalidation: "+' '.join(a['invalidationConditions'])]
  c=json.loads((out/'challenge.json').read_text());review=next(r['challenge'] for r in c['records'] if r['id']==x['id']);lines+=['Challenge: '+review['rationale'],'Tests: '+'; '.join(review['counterTests'])]
 write('DFR_04_BATCH_ASSESSMENTS.md',lines)
 lines=['# DFR-04 Rubric Completion Matrix','Every one of 138 issuer/rubric instances follows. Detailed topic dependencies, candidate locators, qualified topic completeness and resolution owner are in completion-matrix.json. An incomplete candidate mapping is not qualified evidence and is not automatically assigned a band. No NA, missing-as-zero, redistributed weights or incomplete totals.', '| Issuer | Completed | NOT_RATED | Complete scorecard |\n|---|---:|---:|---|']
 for t in ['FPT','VNM','BID','TCX','VIC','VHM']:
  own=[x for x in rows if x['ticker']==t];n=sum(x['status']=='COMPLETED_RESEARCH' for x in own);lines[-1]+=f'\n| {t} | {n}/23 | {23-n} | No |'
 for t in ['FPT','VNM','BID','TCX','VIC','VHM']:
  lines.append('## '+t)
  for x in [x for x in rows if x['ticker']==t]:
   if x['status']=='COMPLETED_RESEARCH':lines.append(f"**{x['id']}** — COMPLETED_RESEARCH {x['points']}/{x['maxPoints']}; {'new' if x['newCompleted'] else 'inherited unchanged'}; {x['band']}.")
   else:
    d=x['deferred'];lines.append(f"**{x['id']}** — {d['classification']}. Topics: {', '.join(d['requiredTopics'])}. Dependency: {d['exactDependency']} Context: {d['issuerContext']} Resolution {d['resolutionPath']} / {d['resolutionOwner']}; candidate pointers in JSON, not admitted facts.")
 write('DFR_04_RUBRIC_COMPLETION_MATRIX.md',lines)
 lines=['# DFR-04 Escalated Blockers','These root blockers persisted through DFR01–03 (more than two review cycles). Do not create an automatic DFR05 or repeat a generic DATA_MISSING worklist. The four pending analytical judgments are closed in this package. Remaining branches have finite deliverables and a stop condition.','**E1 — MAJOR, comparative nonfinancial evidence. Owner decision required.** Approve a finite source-scope amendment for a dated six-issuer comparative industry/business pack and governance/minority-outcome records, with named sources and period/cutoff requirements, or accept these rubrics remaining NOT_RATED. Existing statements/API alone cannot establish relative share/cost, durable moat or minority treatment. The recovered VNM annual report already supports its bounded industry/risk assessments; do not source that same content again. Scope the remaining pack to exact uncovered topics and issuers. Do not reacquire the same financial files. Financial-PDF acquisition remains Vietstock-only; no expansion of source policy is implied by this proposal. Closure: exact topic-bound evidence and counterevidence, not another inventory.','**E2 — MAJOR, retained disclosures require analytical reconciliation.** No owner resubmission needed. The concrete resolution product is a six-issuer sector schedule: matched obligations/maturities/covenants/unrestricted funds; asset-quality/capital bridge; corporate-action-adjusted growth and realized investment cohorts. Reuse candidate-index locators and prior pinned metrics. Assign a named analyst to this finite reconciliation if owner approves further work; stop a branch where the required contract/covenant/outcome is not disclosed and explicitly record the missing field. Do not infer covenant compliance from an unmodified opinion or lender renewal expectations. No further work is started here.','**E3 — MAJOR, valuation binding.** Owner must choose a single research cutoff and approve explicit economic assumptions before existing conditional models can support price/value judgments. Then bind a verified dated quote, full share/action basis, normalized common denominator and sector cross-check. FPT needs FTEL cash/scope reconciliation; VNM recurring finance/owner cash and reinvestment assumptions; BID regulatory capital/distributable earnings; TCX minor printed common-numerator conflict; VIC NCI/tax/sponsor/EV funding waterfall; VHM project RNAV, debt/partner restrictions and NCI allocation. No quote, share count, publication date or terminal input is invented.','**E4 — MINOR, TCX 1 VND printed common-numerator conflict.** Reconcile the exact printed common numerator against retained operands and record source/display rounding separately. Keep DFR02 conditional estimate references in CONFLICT until exact lineage is resolved. This is not a material economic discrepancy and does not change rubric disposition to MATERIAL_CONFLICT by default. TCX valuation remains deferred for substantial price/action/normalization dependencies under E3; cash realization and RG-UNC are unaffected. Closure is a signed exact operand/source reconciliation, without changing immutable historical records.','**E5 — MINOR, OCR layout. Resolved locally.** VIC86 and VHM20 column order was checked on the original PDFs. Keep source extraction immutable; consume the bounded reviewed observation with current/prior column tags. Do not silently patch source JSON or carry a corrected amount into unreviewed downstream estimates.','Severity at handoff: **Critical 0; Major 3 open root blockers (E1–E3); Minor 1 open (E4) and 1 resolved (E5)**. These are research-completion issues, not a whole-system production release audit. No complete issuer scorecard, ranking or investment decision is authorized.']
 write('DFR_04_ESCALATED_BLOCKERS.md',lines)
